The version here is based on Michael Martin Murphey superb rendition.  To play the original version from the Pioneers skip the first verse and play the last verse twice with the chords from the previous verse played in between as an instrumental bridge.

TIP:  For the intro strum one |A| strongly and sing the line and begin strumming with the (D) on "weeds."  The note to begin singing is the <a> - 3rd string of the (A).
  
   
